   "widgets_values": [
    "Character reference LoRA for MOSS-Image SFT\n\n1. Pick your character picture in Load Image: one character on a plain white background, whole outfit visible.\n2. Write the scene and pose as tags in the prompt.\n3. Queue.\n\nNeeds the custom node folder moss_image_charref in ComfyUI/custom_nodes.\n\nIn ComfyUI's models folder:\ndiffusion_models/moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors\ntext_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_bf16.safetensors\nvae/flux2-vae.safetensors\nloras/moss_image_edit_charref_v2.safetensors\n\nKeep the edit format, 50 steps, CFG 3, LoRA strength 1.0 and the 448 px reference: these are the settings the results were measured with. Tested at about 0.6 megapixels."
   ],
